75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/proverki\">Проверки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Приходи, разходи, дълг\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/byudzhet\">Бюджет</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Договори, фирми, риск, връзки с политици\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/porachki\">Поръчки</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Растеж, инфлация, заплати, жилища\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ikonomika\">Икономика</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Цените в магазините по вериги и места\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/ceni\">Цени</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Вашата община: пари, поръчки, съвет\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/mesta\">Места</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-a